  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Res 8505.01 Penalties. A person who violates any rule of Res 8500 shall be guilty of a violation as provided for by RSA 215-A:19, I and RSA 215-C:34, I and shall be subject to a fine pursuant to RSA 651:2, III-a, IV(a), and Res 7802.04 and 7802.06.\n\nSource. #4391-a, eff 3-30-88; EXPIRED 3-30-94\n\nNew. #5946, eff 12-23-94, EXPIRED: 12-23-02\n\nNew. #7457, eff 3-1-01; ss by #9478, eff 5-23-09; ss by #10905, eff 8-5-15",
